# ERP integration (Tally / Excel)

Read `docs/erp/PROGRESS.md` before continuing. Resume at the first unfinished stage. Backend implementation lives in `vayuraai-be` on branch `feat/erp-tally-excel`.

- Imported lines stay staged until a human approves them. Never auto-approve.
- Connectors UI is visible only when `permissions.canManageTenant`. The backend is the real gate.
- Upload and review keep today's permissions and maker-checker. Show per-line flags, exclude, correction approve, and 409 `ALREADY_POSTED`.
- Source filter on emissions and dashboard: All, Upload, Tally, Excel, Manual.
- No Zoho API, OAuth, or credential encryption UI.
- Loading, empty, error, disabled, and permission-denied states are required on new screens.
- Do not redesign unrelated pages.
